        "estimand": "token_delta over One complete renewal-only ceiling statement; the policy reference and any named holding set are identical in both arms.: Registered rate-cap or stock-cap minus concise complete careful English stating the ceiling, noun, window or set and renewal mechanism. No alignment assertion in either arm. Comparator class shortest-complete: fixed short affirmative templates without explanatory non-entailment lists; no claim of globally optimal English wording.; population: 128 prospectively authored renewal-only statements, 64 per marker, eight per marker in each of eight domains: API requests, storage objects, licence grants, connections, messages, parking permits, retry attempts and memory blocks. Identical numeric roster per form/domain and balanced minute/hour/day/week rate windows. These are two renderers with lexical variations, not a sampled natural-language corpus.; aggregation: Equal item mean inside each of the two equally weighted form strata, then maximum tokenizer mean. Report the complete form-by-tokenizer matrix. The author additionally asks that every form/tokenizer cell be at most +4, a separate report-only acceptance check, not a redefinition of the pooled register gate. Separately preregistered report-only diagnostic: 64 alignment-bearing pairs, bank SHA-256 92c3cc577c61d71dc75bcae30dd1c5731f4e735908ed1b9eeef14bbd22281bb8, counted after the gated result and never pooled into it.",
